cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Phytospectra — a phytointelligence platform for NMR–MS natural products analysis"
abstract: >-
  Phytospectra is research software for NMR, mass spectrometry, and
  metabolomics evidence processing. The real orchestrated workflow is
  bounded local reference-HSQC ranking with mandatory human review;
  other orchestrated workflows are explicitly labelled offline demonstrations.
  Scientific identification accuracy has not been established.
type: software
